+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use LRU (Least Recently Used) eviction for the cache layer, with a fixed cache TTL of 300 seconds. LRU was chosen because its semantics are simpler to reason about, which makes cache behavior more predictable and easier to debug and maintain.
